00:18:12.191 --> 00:18:14.293
Like, Oh, it all stands for an acronym.

00:18:14.493 --> 00:18:17.362
The Wisdom of Solomon,
The Strength of Hercules, the Stamina

00:18:17.362 --> 00:18:21.467
of Atlas, The Power of Zeus, The Courage
of Achilles in the Speed of Mercury.

00:18:21.800 --> 00:18:24.336
The joke about the wisdom of Solomon is
