00:18:24.336 --> 00:18:25.671
Literally being super smart.

00:18:25.671 --> 00:18:27.072
It's more about the wisdom in his heart.

00:18:27.072 --> 00:18:28.774
Like emotional smarts.

00:18:28.774 --> 00:18:32.010
In the comics, it was more of a
traditional intelligence kind of power.

00:18:32.211 --> 00:18:34.980
Originally gave him
clairvoyance, awareness and battle.

00:18:34.980 --> 00:18:37.182
It also gave him knowledge
of all languages,

00:18:37.182 --> 00:18:40.552
ancient and modern warfare,
and allowed him to hypnotize people.

00:18:40.853 --> 00:18:42.387
The other joke
here, too, is that Billy says

